      {
        "number": 13,
        "internalPageId": 14,
        "title": "What a great place! Venezuela is a majestic country. It has amazing places such as beaches, highlands, rivers, jungles, etc. It is located in South America and it is named the country of happy people. Its beaches are clear and they have warm water. Its highlands are fresh and they also have cold areas. Its Jungle has big, green and rocky mountains called Tepuyes. Small towns are picturesque and they have warm people. Visit this country if you have the chance.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "What a great place! Venezuela is a majestic country. It has amazing places such as beaches, highlands, rivers, jungles, etc. It is located in South America and it is named the country of happy people. Its beaches are clear and they have warm water. Its highlands are fresh and they also have cold areas. Its Jungle has big, green and rocky mountains called Tepuyes. Small towns are picturesque and they have warm people. Visit this country if you have the chance.",
          "C. Read the following paragraph and identify what the adjectives are. After that, Answer the questions below. Finally, read it aloud with your teacher.",
          "1. What is the country’s name? 2. Is it a majestic country? 3. What amazing places does it have? 4. Where is it located? 5. How are its people described? 6. How are the beaches? 7. Does it have cold areas? 8. Describe the towns."
        ],
        "links": [],
